# Generator output. Every one of these is rebuilt from the schemas in this repo
# by `npm run start` or `npm test`, nothing in src/, tests/ or the published
# tarball reads them, and CI regenerates them on every push. Tracking them only
# gives contributors a diff to accidentally commit and lets the copy in git rot
# out of step with the generator while CI stays green.
/generated/
prisma/generated/
tests/generated/
